id: raging
name: Raging
kind: state
levels: 3
description: >
  Fury sharpens what you can land and dulls what you can feel.
text: >
  Narrative Requirement: A boiling rage, driven by some kind of intense fury related to your Z-Soul.

  Angry (Level 1)
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls of your Attacking Maneuvers by L(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase the Botch Range of your Strike Rolls, Dodge Rolls, Saving Throws, and Skill Checks by L.

  Furious (Level 2)
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Soak Value by L(T).

  Apoplectic (Level 3)
  (1)-[Triggered/Apoplectic, Triggered/Start of Turn, 1/Round]: You may use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
  (2)-[Passive]: Ignore any Health Threshold Penalties.

---

# Everything accumulates upwards: at level 3 the level 1 and level 2 effects are still running, and they are worth 3(T)
# rather than 1(T), because L is the level reached and not the level that unlocked them.

# Angry (1), (2) - the Botch Range of every roll but the Wound Roll (chat.mjs botchRangeFor).
[passive from 1]
wound += L(T);
botchRange.notWound += L;

# Furious (1)
[passive from 2]
soakValue += L(T);

# Apoplectic (2)
[passive from 3]
threshold.penalty = 0;

# Apoplectic (1): entering Apoplectic - Raging entered at it, or gone up to it (state-level, a new moment) - and as your
# turn begins: a button, never Automatic (it hands over an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver); the Basic Attack out of sequence, once
# a Round between the three (chat.mjs rageStrike).
[triggered/state/raging, from 3, outOfSequence]
rageStrike();

[triggered/state-level/raging, from 3, outOfSequence]
rageStrike();

[triggered/start-of-turn from 3, outOfSequence]
rageStrike();
